        "richtext_NT7QmM": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>AT LEGXI, Every collectible begins with a question:<br\/>How do you preserve sporting greatness?<\/p><p>The answer became a design language built around Argentina itself.<\/p><p>Each artwork starts with the silhouette of the nation, transformed into a canvas that celebrates the athlete's journey, achievements, and connection to Argentine football. Layers of typography, historical references, and 24K gold-plated detailing are then carefully integrated to create a piece that feels equally at home in a private collection, office, or gallery.<\/p><p>The final step is the most important. The athlete's original signature.<\/p><p>Applied by hand and paired with official authentication, it transforms the artwork from a tribute into a collectible.<br\/><\/p>",
            "position": "top_left"
          }
        },
        "button_Yb7jzA": {
          "type": "button",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
